  "description": "A Survival Healing Life Begins!\nI reincarnated into the very game I logged into to relax after quitting my soul-crushing black company.\nBut instead of becoming the game's strongest mage, someone even the Emperor dares not provoke, I ended up as Lion Asteri, that mage's frail eldest grandson!\nTo make matters worse, despite suffering three mana shocks, he's still a hopeless case who has yet to awaken his mana.\n\"Could it be that the young master will actually become the head of the family?\"\n\"Shh! Watch what you're saying! What if someone hears you?\"\nFine by me, keep talking all you want!\nNow that I've reincarnated as a carefree young master born with a silver spoon, I have absolutely no interest in becoming the successor.\nThis time, I'm going to enjoy a comfortable, laid-back healing life no matter what!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69613701/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%9B%84%EA%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EB%8A%94-%EB%AA%A8%EB%A5%B4%EA%B2%A0%EA%B3%A0-%ED%9E%90%EB%A7%81%EC%9D%B4%EB%82%98-%ED%95%98%EB%A0%B5%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4/4907)",
